{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2022-10-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'BRASKEM IDESA WORKS WITH EMERSON TO DRIVE OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE, ACHIEVE SUSTAINABILITY GOALS', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLOBAL SOFTWARE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER EMERSON (NYSE: EMR) TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH BRASKEM IDESA TO PROVIDE DIGITAL AUTOMATION TECHNOLOGIES AND ENGINEERING SERVICES ACROSS ITS OPERATIONS TO MEET BUSINESS PERFORMANCE METRICS AND ACHIEVE ITS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS.'}